Vendored Ubuntu noble libfuse3 3.14.0-5build1 (arm64) for
cross-compiling modelfs. The `.deb` files are unmodified Ubuntu
archive artifacts; SHA256SUMS is the digest list extract and
build.zig both verify.

Upstream: https://github.com/libfuse/libfuse
Ubuntu pool URLs and refresh steps: README.md in this directory.

The shared library this project links (libfuse3, `lib/*` in upstream)
is LGPL-2.1-or-later. Other files in the source package are GPL-2.
The Debian copyright file covering these exact packages is `copyright`
in this directory (extracted from libfuse3-3).

modelfs is GPL-3.0-or-later and links libfuse3 dynamically.
